. program define figsave
  1.     * Export the current graph to 04_figures at a consistent size.
.     * Width 2000px at the report's 6.5 inch text width is about 300 dpi.
.     syntax , NAME(string) [WIDTH(integer 2000)]
  2.     quietly graph export "${FIGS}/`name'.png", replace width(`width')
  3.     display as text "  figure -> 04_figures/`name'.png"
  4. end

