> ows short of the detail file. It carries no respondent identifier and cannot 
> be joined to the 2,227-row detail file; it supports a marginal distribution o
> f home ZIPs and nothing else. `CAV'")

. cnum, key(census_zip_distinct) value(`NZIPD') unit("distinct ZIP codes") sour
> ce("`SRCZ'") ///
