> 1 and 742 creatives. This reproduces the published average annual spend of ab
> out 10,500 dollars (Data Appendix p.46) to within 1 percent, and shows what t
> hat headline is: an addition of eight separately based averages, not the mean
>  of any single respondent total. `CAV'")

